{
  "id": "T18_15_milestone_publication_revises_a_limitation_beginning_of_a_story",
  "family": "T18",
  "rules": [
    "7.6.6",
    "7.6.9",
    "7.6.10",
    "4.2.4",
    "4.4.1",
    "9.5.3",
    "9.5.7",
    "9.6.1",
    "9.5.8"
  ],
  "description": "One side of a recorded conflict story is A-601's statement at the architect's planned 100% CD, which has no occurrence time, so the story's beginning cannot be placed. Its begin act records the limitation {limitation: no_occurrence_time, records: [that statement]}, and open stories and what remains list the story among their limitations. Publishing the milestone fixes the statement's occurrence time; the publication write revises the begin act to the definite beginning at the publication instant, as written in @published. The story is then not_started before that instant and open after it.",
